e, Health, and Equipped Tool.\n- Team Check: toggle between enemies only and all players.\n- Vehicle ESP: Tanks, APCs, and transport tracking across the map.\n- Vehicle Status: smart color coding for enemy-occupied vs empty/abandoned vehicles.\n- Chams / Highlight: outline and fill with customizable transparency.\n\n[ Combat / Aimbot ]\n- Aimbot: smooth aiming assistance.\n- FOV Circle: customizable radius display.\n- Target Bone: Head or Torso selection.\n- Wall Check: visibility verification behind obstacles.\n\n[ Misc ]\n- Instant Prompt: instant interaction with prompts without hold delay.\n- Auto Ammo: grab ammo from ToolGivers in one click.\n- Auto Jerrycan: instant fuel canister pickup.\n- Rejoin Server: fast server reconnect.\n\n[ UI & System ]\n- Obsidian Dark UI: clean, minimalist dark theme.\n- Watermark HUD: displays current FPS, ping, and server time.\n- Config System: saves all settings to local config file.\n- Security: rendered via CoreGui, fully isolated from game scripts.","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"https://ads.pandauth.com/getkey/1337","owner":{"_id":"66da00126800ca5fd766d9c8","username":"WeeeK1337","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/48076105a79727e9e1ef5cd80fa311bf5bf1c7c2ef60d19985e1702ad8f165f4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66da00126800ca5fd766d9c8-1789056778747.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"66da00126800ca5fd766d9c8","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/48076105a79727e9e1ef5cd80fa311bf5bf1c7c2ef60d19985e1702ad8f165f4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66da00126800ca5fd766d9c8-1789056778747.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T00:30:09.311Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6aa0498737432c6d3